rooms_desc ({"WelcomeThats what you see on the doormat...","He is the ultimate dragon and the one and only PowerMonk.Lord Smorlok has a scar on his right leg, his nose and his left hand.He is feeling very well. Smorlok's beautiful body is athletic and well built. On his arm you see the symbol of a 'golden Dragon'. 0 is very happily married to 0.        Smorlok is carrying: Oaken ring (worn)Oaken ring (worn) Oaken mask (worn)A strong golden belt (worn) A white gold wedding ring (worn) ","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
